@RubberDuck_HostAddress = http://localhost:5235

### Health check
GET {{RubberDuck_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Random duck
GET {{RubberDuck_HostAddress}}/api/duck
Accept: application/json

### Quote from API Ninjas
GET https://api.api-ninjas.com/v2/randomquotes?categories=courage
X-Api-Key: {{apiNinjasKey}}